    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Chesser Auctioneers present this five-bedroom semi-detached property, built in 1969 and located on a large, elevated corner site within an established cul-de-sac development.\nThe property extends to approximately 144 sq. m. (1,550 sq. ft.) and provides five bedrooms, two reception rooms, kitchen, utility room and two bathrooms. The gardens to the side and rear are enclosed, mature and well maintained.\nThe property is located within walking distance of Jetland Shopping Centre, Thomond Park and the Gaelic Grounds. It is also close to a number of primary, secondary and third-level educational facilities, including TUS Moylish Campus, Thomond Community College, Caherdavin National Schools, JFK National School and Ardscoil Rís.\nLimerick City Centre is within a short drive or bus journey, with a bus stop located within a 2 minute walk from the property. There is also convenient access to the N18 Shannon/Galway Road, M20 Cork route and M7 Dublin route.\nAccommodation\nGround Floor\nEntrance Hall:\nLaminate flooring \nLiving Room:\nSpacious reception room with feature fireplace, marble hearth and inset stove. French doors lead to the dining room.\nDining Room:\nLarge reception room with laminate flooring and feature fireplace. \nKitchen:\nFully fitted timber kitchen with laminate flooring.\nUtility Room:\nFully fitted with laminate flooring.\nBedroom 1/Office:\nDouble bedroom with carpet flooring.\nEn-Suite Bathroom:\nFully tiled with walk-in shower, W.C. and W.H.B. \nFirst Floor\nLanding:\nCarpet flooring with hotpress off.\nBedroom 2:\nSingle bedroom with carpet flooring.\nBedroom 3:\nDouble bedroom with carpet flooring, wall-to-wall built-in wardrobes and vanity unit.\nBedroom 4:\nDouble bedroom with carpet flooring and built-in wardrobes.\nBedroom 5:\nDouble bedroom with carpet flooring.\nBathroom:\nFully tiled with shower, bath, W.C. and W.H.B.\nOutside\nFront:\nTarmacadam driveway for 4 cars and off-street parking.\nSide & Rear:\nLarge rear garden with mature planting.\n"
      },
      {
